  "summary": "Malicious code in @onereach/v-event-calendar (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook (node setup.mjs) downloads the Bun JavaScript runtime and then executes a bundled 727KB heavily-obfuscated file (math_init.js) containing a custom string decoder, eval/Function calls, and child_process usage. A Vue event-calendar plugin has no legitimate reason to download a runtime and run an obfuscated payload at install time. The same setup.mjs + math_init.js payload is shipped in @onereach/webform@0.3.15.",
